  {
    "source": 10,
    "widget": "text-editor",
    "settings": {
      "editor": "<p>At ANZ Landscaping, we <strong>specialize in commercial landscaping solutions</strong> that enhance the aesthetics, functionality, and sustainability of business environments. Our expertise lies in crafting professionally designed landscapes that reflect your brand identity while providing a welcoming and refreshing outdoor experience.</p><p>Whether you're a <strong>corporate office, hotel, real estate developer, or educational institution</strong>, our team ensures a seamless blend of nature and architecture, creating spaces that inspire productivity and relaxation.</p>"
    }
  },
